  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nMy homeserver receives around 48k `send` PUTs per day. They are all completely useless presence messages. This adds up to a couple of gigs of traffic over a month.\r\n\r\nI had joined a federated room, but I've since left. \r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- install synapse\r\n- join a room\r\n- leave the room\r\n- monitor incoming ECUs\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Homeserver**: matrix.macdermid.ca\r\n\r\nIf not matrix.org:\r\n\r\n- **Version**:  \"server_version\":\"1.26.0\",\"python_version\":\"3.8.7\"}\r\n\r\n- **Install method**: docker\r\n\r\n- **Platform**: armv7 on small single-board computer",
